WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:09.360
Having both accomplished a major goal, Satoshi and Go
were enjoying their camping trip with Koharu.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:16.620
But a slight disparity in their feelings
ended up straining their relationship.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.420
Then, the Legendary Pokémon Lugia
appeared before them.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.170
Lucario, I choose you!

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.510
Inteleon, go!

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:44.400
Lugia, it’s a Raid Battle!

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:53.410
Satoshi and Go!

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:53.410
A New Departure!!

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.500
Pikachu, use 100,000 Volts!

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:13.300
We’re right behind you!
Aceburn, use Pyro Ball!

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.610
It didn’t work?

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.400
Hydro Pump!

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.740
Lucario! Aura Sphere!

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:34.280
Inteleon! Snipe Shot!

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:39.580
Dodge it!

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:42.290
It’s so powerful...

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:43.460
Go!

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:44.790
Yeah. Let’s do this!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:45.790
Pikachu!

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:46.790
Aceburn!

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.250
Lightning Speed!

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:52.800
Aceburn, kick Pikachu!

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:00.930
All right!

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:09.530
Lucario! Bullet Punch!

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:11.240
Inteleon! Aqua Break!

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:25.710
Aceburn!

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.890
Let’s hit it with our full power!

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.640
Let’s go, everyone!

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:46.190
Aceburn! Pyro Ball!

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.570
Lucario!
Wrap it in an Aura Sphere!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.990
Sarunori! Wood Hammer!

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:59.490
Inteleon, you use Mud Shot!

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:01.830
Pikachu, you use 100,000 Volts!

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:14.380
Now!

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.430
Did it work?

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.890
Monster Ball... Go!

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.520
Aeroblast?!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:20.760
The world...
It really is huge!

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.220
Yeah.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.220
Satoshi...

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.600
I said I wanted
to go on a journey...

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:32.900
But can I really go out
into this huge world, all alone?

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:37.530
You were there for me all this time,
so anything was possible.

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:39.530
But...

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:45.450
But I’ve just... been worrying...
and worrying...

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.120
What are you talking about?

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:47.910
Huh?

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:51.580
You got picked
as a member of Project Mew,

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.170
and you even got to <i>meet</i> Mew!

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.670
If you’re ever worried,
you should tell me!

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:00.420
After all...

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.260
We’re friends, right?

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:04.300
Yeah...

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.850
Satoshi!

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:07.100
Here we go!

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:14.270
Lugia just said
“Here we go!”

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:16.110
I heard it, too!

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.570
Where are we going?!

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:12.120
Pokémon really are...

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.160
...awesome!

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.790
<i>This</i> is it, Go!

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:16.370
Huh?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.880
This is why I want
to go on a journey!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:23.420
The thrill and excitement
of meeting new Pokémon?

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:24.220
Yeah!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:28.050
I wanna see more of them, know more about them,
make friends with more of them!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.350
Yeah, I get it!

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:33.020
I wanna see more, know more,
and make friends with more of them, too!

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:36.690
If that leads me to learn more
about Pokémon and the world,

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:39.400
then I might be able to face up to Mew
and make friends with it!

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.150
You wanna make friends with Mew?

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:42.440
That sounds great!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.530
Yeah!

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.530
Go!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.780
Satoshi!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:56.620
I’m going on a journey, too!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.180
Hey!

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.440
Go?! Satoshi?!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.190
Koharu!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.200
I see.

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:32.780
I understand how you feel.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.490
Very well!
Go for it and have fun!

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.950
Thank you!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.960
I should be the one
thanking you two.

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:43.090
The two of you have helped deepen
our understanding of Pokémon.

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:44.460
Truly, thank you!

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:48.260
Even if you’re gone for a long time,
I hope you enjoy it!

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.470
I hope you’ll remember
to keep in touch!

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:52.010
We will!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:53.970
But are you really sure?

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.810
You’ll be losing
two research fellows...

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:00.100
Oh, don’t you worry about that.

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:03.610
We’re going to be
the new research fellows.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:05.070
Huh?!

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:07.150
Koharu and Eevee?!

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.360
Yeah!

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:13.410
I thought I’d like to learn more
about Pokémon and the world, too.

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:17.620
And Eevee has lots of
different evolutions, right?

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:20.040
There could even be more
we just don’t know about.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:25.920
Though I’ll still be going to school,
so we’ll just be research fellows on the weekends.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:26.920
I see.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.590
I hope we meet
somewhere out there!

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:29.510
Yup!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:35.050
The other concern I had were
my Pokémon at Sakuragi Park...

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:37.060
You can leave them with us.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:39.520
We’ll take care of their needs.

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:41.140
Yup.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.480
Look! Wanpachi’s excited, too!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:46.070
Thank you!

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:47.440
Good news, huh, Go?

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.230
Yeah!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:51.030
So, when are you going to leave?

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:52.320
Tomorrow!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.070
Huh?!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.700
Here is our report,
Sakaki, sir!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:01.790
Through our flawless maneuvers
at the Masters Tournament...

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:05.000
...we have discovered the world’s
strongest Pokémon, meow.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.290
Oh?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.250
And where may this Pokémon be?

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.710
Within our reach!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.130
If we desire it...

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.510
...we could procure it
anytime, meow!

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:17.760
I am counting on you.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.270
<i>Sir!</i>

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:21.180
You hear that?

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.520
Sure did!

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.560
If he’s counting on us...

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:28.440
When the day comes that our
Pikachu capture operation succeeds...

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.240
<i>We’ll be promoted to admins!
Made branch managers!</i>

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:32.950
<i>What a great feeling!</i>

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:35.780
PocketMonsters

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.280
<i>Pocket Monsters!</i>

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:50.460
Cleaning’s all done!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:54.090
All right. Let’s go and feed
the Pokémon in the park.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.090
Okay.

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:08.560
What’s wrong, Pikachu?

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.780
Mom! Professor Okido!

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:18.160
Dad! Mom!
Even Grandma!

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.330
To commemorate your departure...

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:24.040
<i>It’s a surprise party!</i>

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.830
Such nice weather...

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:53.170
What’s that?!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.670
They said it!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.550
If you ask us about “this” or “that”...

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.630
We’ll answer out of
sympathy for the world!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.560
To protect the world from devastation!

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.470
To preserve world peace!

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.940
Championing the evils
of truth and love!

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:13.690
We’re the lovely, charming villains!

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:14.940
Musashi!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.150
Kojiro!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.950
The Team Rocket duo
soars through the galaxy!

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:22.910
Like a white hole,
a white tomorrow awaits us!

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:25.280
Just kidding, meow!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.250
You again?!

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:36.750
Words as bland as “again”
aren’t in our vocabulary!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:41.510
Until the day we steal Pikachu
and present him to Sakaki, we are <i>forever!</i>

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:43.260
We’ll never stop trying!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.140
For we are Team Rocket!

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:47.640
Musashi, Kojiro, Nyarth, and...

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.270
...Sonansu!

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:51.060
They never give up!

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:52.640
Pikachu, use 100,000 Volts!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.940
As always, this capsule
blocks electricity, meow—

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:17.210
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.970
Hey. Have you decided
where you’re gonna go?

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:28.560
First, I guess I want to tour Kanto.

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:30.680
There’s still places I’ve never been.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.350
How about you?

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:33.690
I haven’t decided.

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:35.940
I’ll walk and walk
and keep on walking,

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:37.860
just going whatever way I want.

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:38.980
I see.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.570
So what path are you taking now?

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:46.660
Straight ahead!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.000
This is great!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:59.880
The way that you go will determine
the Pokémon you’ll meet, and the adventures you’ll have!

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:02.510
Yeah. And the choice is yours.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:05.340
Yeah! It’s mine!

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.200
Let’s both say it together!

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.200
All right!

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.660
Ready, and...

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.280
This way!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.670
Looks like we part here.

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:37.750
Yeah!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.170
Go...

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.760
I’m glad I met you.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.510
Thank you.

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.050
Stop it!

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.810
What’s gotten into you?

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:54.100
You’re gonna make me cry...

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.110
Satoshi...

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:06.110
Thanks for reaching out to me.

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:12.370
We could find something
even <i>more</i> amazing waiting up ahead!

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.490
Right!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.000
And that future lies...

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:16.500
Right!

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:21.750
...in our hands!

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:26.970
See you!

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:27.880
Yeah!

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:53.330
Go!

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.250
Satoshi...

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:05.210
Make sure you find that Mew again
and make friends with it!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.130
I will!

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:11.510
And Satoshi, make sure you become
a Pokémon Master!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.140
Yeah!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.850
Let’s go, Sarunori!

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:29.860
Let’s go, Pikachu!

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:38.080
Do you remember
the day we set off from Masara Town?

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.370
It was just like this!

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:42.210
The sky, the trees, the Pokémon...

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.840
They were all shining so bright!

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:47.710
Yahoo!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:58.270
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:00.810
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:03.650
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:06.150
And skip the slow send-off

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:08.820
Be it through fire or through water

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:11.360
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:16.370
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:21.200
Each and every one of my memories

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:26.750
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.420
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:36.050
I've got my plans for when I grow up in my pocket

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:42.270
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:46.560
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:47.810
Let's have a fight!

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.650
1. Once the battle's done

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.490
2. And we're laughing or crying

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:57.160
On 3, let's be friends!

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:03.330
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:08.670
With this unpredictable, unfathomable world awaiting

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:11.210
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:15.380
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.840
I choose you!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:25.640
The view from the next town

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.230
The wide breathtaking world

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:31.020
It all rushes past with dizzying speed

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:33.490
Leaving me behind

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:36.150
Even the little holes to slip through

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.660
that intrigued me so much in younger days

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:42.990
Have I just not been looking for them lately?

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:50.210
But remember, all that forgotten scenery

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:54.760
is still somewhere out there today!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.930
On 1, 2, 3, leap out!

00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:01.510
Out of the miserable days of tears,

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:04.930
and out of your Ball

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:08.150
"Where should we go?", you ask?

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:10.940
The answer's gotta be "Everywhere!"

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:15.240
No time (No time!) to catch your breath! Try! (Try!)

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:16.320
Why don't we go?

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:19.070
1. Once the battle's done

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.160
2. And we're laughing or crying

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:25.910
On 3, let's be friends!

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:32.000
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:37.340
With this unpredictable, unfathomable world awaiting

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.840
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:44.100
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:45.890
I choose you!

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:38.150
I wonder where those two are right now...
and what they’re up to.

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:57.250
All right! I caught it!

00:22:44.220 --> 00:22:47.470
The world of Pocket Monsters
stretches on endlessly...

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:56.100
The lives and adventures of
Satoshi, Go, and Koharu will continue on.

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:58.360
If I say they continue,
continue they will.
